      </a>
      <a href="/lab/" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-obs-border bg-obs-panel hover:border-sky-500/50 transition">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400 mb-1">测试依据 &rarr;</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-obs-text">测速实验室实测报告</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-obs-muted mt-1">查阅 41 个品牌原始测速快照与换算表</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/lines/" class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-obs-border bg-obs-panel hover:border-purple-500/50 transition">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 mb-1">技术剖析 &rarr;</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-obs-text">线路架构与专线原理</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-obs-muted mt-1">拆解 IEPL、IPLC 与 BGP 中转物理拓扑</div>
